                <pb facs="0744" n="664" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg664"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port au Prince</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-22"><hi rendition="#italic">September 22,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports that it is stated by the Government that a chartered vessel
                    is cruising at each blockaded place, and suggests that this statement be
                    verified by the <hi rendition="#italic">Montgomery</hi>).</p>
            </div>
        </body>
